 "post": {
  "title": "The Waiter Trick That Doubles Tips #shorts",
  "description": "Zoe's café tips are tiny until she starts repeating orders back word for word. van Baaren, Holland, Steenaert & van Knippenberg (2003): a waitress in the Netherlands who repeated customers' orders verbatim received almost twice the tips she got when she didn't. People warm to those who mirror them. #psychology #shorts #mirroring #likability",
